, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.047067933333547494, "compression_ratio": 1.597457627118644, "no_speech_prob": 0.04722249135375023}, {"id": 39, "seek": 19300, "start": 215.0, "end": 221.0, "text": " Hmm. That's the one. I knew a bit about it already, but not about this research.", "tokens": [51464, 8239, 13, 663, 311, 264, 472, 13, 286, 2586, 257, 857, 466, 309, 1217, 11, 457, 406, 466, 341, 2132, 13, 51764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.047067933333547494, "compression_ratio": 1.597457627118644, "no_speech_prob": 0.04722249135375023}, {"id": 40, "seek": 22100, "start": 221.0, "end": 228.0, "text": " His analysis of figures comparing the times of the fires and the proportion of seeds that germinated", "tokens": [50364, 2812, 5215, 295, 9624, 15763, 264, 1413, 295, 264, 15044, 293, 264, 16068, 295, 9203, 300, 19858, 5410, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06070618698562401, "compression_ratio": 1.5520833333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.07665607333183289}, {"id": 41, "seek": 22100, "start": 228.0, "end": 232.0, "text": " was done in a lot of detail. Very impressive.", "tokens": [50714, 390, 1096, 294, 257, 688, 295, 2607, 13, 4372, 8992, 13, 50914], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06070618698562401, "compression_ratio": 1.5520833333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.07665607333183289}, {"id": 42, "seek": 22100, "start": 232.0, "end": 238.0, "text": " Was that the article with the illustrations of early stages of plant development?", "tokens": [50914, 3027, 300, 264, 7222, 365, 264, 34540, 295, 2440, 10232, 295, 3709, 3250, 30, 51214], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06070618698562401, "compression_ratio": 1.5520833333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.07665607333183289}, {"id": 43, "seek": 22100, "start": 238.0, "end": 240.0, "text": " They were very clear.", "tokens": [51214, 814, 645, 588, 1850, 13, 51314], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06070618698562401, "compression_ratio": 1.5520833333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.07665607333183289}, {"id": 44, "seek": 22100, "start": 240.0, "end": 246.0, "text": " I think those diagrams were in another article.", "tokens": [51314, 286, 519, 729, 36709, 645, 294, 1071, 7222, 13, 51614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.06070618698562401, "compression_ratio": 1.5520833333333333, "no_speech_prob": 0.07665607333183289}, {"id": 45, "seek": 24600, "start": 246.0, "end": 254.0, "text": " Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 26 to 30.", "tokens": [50364, 4546, 291, 1568, 264, 1472, 295, 264, 5017, 11, 291, 362, 512, 565, 281, 574, 412, 1651, 7551, 281, 2217, 13, 50764], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11044350266456604, "compression_ratio": 1.1071428571428572, "no_speech_prob": 0.7672850489616394}, {"id": 46, "seek": 27600, "start": 277.0, "end": 285.0, "text": " Now listen and answer questions 26 to 30.", "tokens": [50414, 823, 2140, 293, 1867, 1651, 7551, 281, 2217, 13, 50814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08243075903359946, "compression_ratio": 1.4278846153846154, "no_speech_prob": 0.06806856393814087}, {"id": 47, "seek": 27600, "start": 285.0, "end": 292.0, "text": " Anyway, shall we have a look at the procedure for our experiment? We'll need to get going with it quite soon.", "tokens": [50814, 5684, 11, 4393, 321, 362, 257, 574, 412, 264, 10747, 337, 527, 5120, 30, 492, 603, 643, 281, 483, 516, 365, 309, 1596, 2321, 13, 51164], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08243075903359946, "compression_ratio": 1.4278846153846154, "no_speech_prob": 0.06806856393814087}, {"id": 48, "seek": 27600, "start": 292.0, "end": 298.0, "text": " Right. So the first thing we have to do is find our seeds.", "tokens": [51164, 1779, 13, 407, 264, 700, 551, 321, 362, 281, 360, 307, 915, 527, 9203, 13, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08243075903359946, "compression_ratio": 1.4278846153846154, "no_speech_prob": 0.06806856393814087}, {"id": 49, "seek": 27600, "start": 298.0, "end": 305.0, "text": " I think vegetable seeds would be best and obviously they mustn't all be the same size.", "tokens": [51464, 286, 519, 16356, 9203, 576, 312, 1151, 293, 2745, 436, 42818, 380, 439, 312, 264, 912, 2744, 13, 51814], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08243075903359946, "compression_ratio": 1.4278846153846154, "no_speech_prob": 0.06806856393814087}, {"id": 50, "seek": 30500, "start": 305.0, "end": 310.0, "text": " So how many sorts do we need? About four different ones?", "tokens": [50364, 407, 577, 867, 7527, 360, 321, 643, 30, 7769, 1451, 819, 2306, 30, 50614], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.060107476002461205, "compression_ratio": 1.5133689839572193, "no_speech_prob": 0.024768704548478127}, {"id": 51, "seek": 30500, "start": 310.0, "end": 315.0, "text": " I think that would be enough. There'll be quite a large number of seeds for each one.", "tokens": [50614, 286, 519, 300, 576, 312, 1547, 13, 821, 603, 312, 1596, 257, 2416, 1230, 295, 9203, 337, 1184, 472, 13, 50864], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.060107476002461205, "compression_ratio": 1.5133689839572193, "no_speech_prob": 0.024768704548478127}, {"id": 52, "seek": 30500, "start": 315.0, "end": 323.0, "text": " Then for each seed we need to find out how much it weighs and also measure its dimensions.", "tokens": [50864, 1396, 337, 1184, 8871, 321, 643, 281, 915, 484, 577, 709, 309, 24911, 293, 611, 3481, 1080, 12819, 13, 51264], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.060107476002461205, "compression_ratio": 1.5133689839572193, "no_speech_prob": 0.024768704548478127}, {"id": 53, "seek": 30500, "start": 323.0, "end": 327.0, "text": " And we need to keep a careful record of all that.", "tokens": [51264, 400, 321, 643, 281, 1066, 257, 5026, 2136, 295, 439, 300, 13, 51464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.060107476002461205, "compression_ratio": 1.5133689839572193, "no_speech_prob": 0.024768704548478127}, {"id": 54, "seek": 32700, "start": 327.0, "end": 334.0, "text": " That'll be quite time consuming and we also need to decide how deep we're going to plant the seeds", "tokens": [50364, 663, 603, 312, 1596, 565, 19867, 293, 321, 611, 643, 281, 4536, 577, 2452, 321, 434, 516, 281, 3709, 264, 9203, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07528559173025735, "compression_ratio": 1.5686274509803921, "no_speech_prob": 0.07505448907613754}, {"id": 55, "seek": 32700, "start": 334.0, "end": 339.0, "text": " right on the surface a few millimetres down or several centimetres.", "tokens": [50714, 558, 322, 264, 3753, 257, 1326, 1728, 26123, 495, 760, 420, 2940, 44755, 495, 13, 50964], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07528559173025735, "compression_ratio": 1.5686274509803921, "no_speech_prob": 0.07505448907613754}, {"id": 56, "seek": 32700, "start": 339.0, "end": 347.0, "text": " Okay. So then we get planting. Do you think we can plant several seeds together in the same plant pot?", "tokens": [50964, 1033, 13, 407, 550, 321, 483, 20585, 13, 1144, 291, 519, 321, 393, 3709, 2940, 9203, 1214, 294, 264, 912, 3709, 1847, 30, 51364], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07528559173025735, "compression_ratio": 1.5686274509803921, "no_speech_prob": 0.07505448907613754}, {"id": 57, "seek": 32700, "start": 347.0, "end": 351.0, "text": " No. I think we need a different one for each seed.", "tokens": [51364, 883, 13, 286, 519, 321, 643, 257, 819, 472, 337, 1184, 8871, 13, 51564], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07528559173025735, "compression_ratio": 1.5686274509803921, "no_speech_prob": 0.07505448907613754}, {"id": 58, "seek": 35100, "start": 351.0, "end": 357.0, "text": " Right. And we'll need to label them. We can use different coloured labels.", "tokens": [50364, 1779, 13, 400, 321, 603, 643, 281, 7645, 552, 13, 492, 393, 764, 819, 42042, 16949, 13, 50664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04988650653673255, "compression_ratio": 1.5903083700440528, "no_speech_prob": 0.2765338718891144}, {"id": 59, "seek": 35100, "start": 357.0, "end": 366.0, "text": " Then we wait for the seeds to germinate. I reckon that'll be about three weeks depending on what the weather's like.", "tokens": [50664, 1396, 321, 1699, 337, 264, 9203, 281, 19858, 13923, 13, 286, 29548, 300, 603, 312, 466, 1045, 3259, 5413, 322, 437, 264, 5503, 311, 411, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04988650653673255, "compression_ratio": 1.5903083700440528, "no_speech_prob": 0.2765338718891144}, {"id": 60, "seek": 35100, "start": 366.0, "end": 372.0, "text": " Then we see if our plants have come up and write down how tall they've grown.", "tokens": [51114, 1396, 321, 536, 498, 527, 5972, 362, 808, 493, 293, 2464, 760, 577, 6764, 436, 600, 7709, 13, 51414], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04988650653673255, "compression_ratio": 1.5903083700440528, "no_speech_prob": 0.2765338718891144}, {"id": 61, "seek": 35100, "start": 372.0, "end": 377.0, "text": " Then all we have to do is look at our numbers and see if there's any relation between them.", "tokens": [51414, 1396, 439, 321, 362, 281, 360, 307, 574, 412, 527, 3547, 293, 536, 498, 456, 311, 604, 9721, 1296, 552, 13, 51664], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.04988650653673255, "compression_ratio": 1.5903083700440528, "no_speech_prob": 0.2765338718891144}, {"id": 62, "seek": 37700, "start": 377.0, "end": 379.0, "text": " That's right.", "tokens": [50364, 663, 311, 558, 13, 50464], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17290023394993373, "compression_ratio": 1.1149425287356323, "no_speech_prob": 0.26510265469551086}, {"id": 63, "seek": 37700, "start": 383.0, "end": 390.0, "text": " That is the end of section three. You now have half a minute to check your answers.", "tokens": [50664, 663, 307, 264, 917, 295, 3541, 1045, 13, 509, 586, 362, 1922, 257, 3456, 281, 1520, 428, 6338, 13, 51014], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.17290023394993373, "compression_ratio": 1.1149425287356323, "no_speech_prob": 0.26510265469551086}, {"id": 64, "seek": 40700, "start": 407.0, "end": 422.0, "text": " Now turn to section four.", "tokens": [50364, 823, 1261, 281, 3541, 1451, 13, 51114], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.29415300157335067, "compression_ratio": 0.7575757575757576, "no_speech_prob": 0.12463834881782532}], "language": "en"}